          "section": "Introduction",
          "quote": "This article presents the results of studies on the eff ect of artificial aging on the structure and properties of the pilot 8 mm thick sheets made of V -1213 alloy with normal plating (A) produced within the conditions of the Kamensk-Uralskii metal lurgical plant. The aging was carried out in three modes within the temperature range of 150 to 190 °C, with curing time used was 16-24 hours. Mode (1) - the aging temperature is close to the lo west boundary of the abovementioned range",
